docs {
  Default-deny check: the same Task search but with NO Authorization header. With
  no bearer to decode, the caller has no scope/org, so no rule matches →
  { "result": false }. In production the gateway/openid-connect would already have
  rejected an unauthenticated request; this shows OPA fails closed regardless.
}
